<title>HONG KONG: Orient Power 1996 net jumps 770 percent.</title>
<headline>Orient Power 1996 net jumps 770 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.8     vs  1.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.4	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  1.61 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    33.10    vs  3.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,242.30 vs  1,689.52</p>
<p>    Company name		 Orient Power Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Orient Power is an electronic products designer and manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.4 H.K. cents vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
